<section class="homecam-section" id="imou-recording"><div class="container"><h2 class="section-title">Wireless NVR: <span>check the whole recording path.</span></h2><p>The N110W/N118W provides central storage and Imou app access. Official specifications distinguish 10/18 total channels from Wi-Fi capacity: up to 8 on 2.4GHz or 12 on 5GHz. Inbound bandwidth is 90Mbps. Storage supports an HDD up to 16TB; confirm the drive is included and suitable.</p><p>A 4K display output is not the same as accepting every 4K camera stream. Imou lists wired access as 10/18 × 5MP on the overview. Confirm 8MP and dual-lens support in the exact recorder datasheet and a pairing test. ONVIF compatibility does not guarantee every smart event or camera setting.</p><p>Choose retention days from actual bitrate, number of streams and recording schedule. AOR storage-saving modes may use a lower frame rate between events; choose continuous full-frame recording when the evidence requirement needs it.</p><a class="homecam-link" href="<?= SITE_URL ?>/ip-camera-installation-karachi">Read our IP and Wi-Fi network planning guide</a></div></section>
